# Summon: G.F. Cerberus is cast on turn 3 (Black Lotus and Mox Ruby); chapter I surveils 1 and Bot1 keeps the Mountain on top.
# Chapter II on turn 5 sets up its delayed ability, which ends with the turn (CR 603.7b): on Bot2's turn 6 Bot1's Lightning Bolt
# is not copied, Bot2 takes 3 once. Chapter III ("Triple") on turn 7 copies the next instant or sorcery twice (CR 707.10), each
